  "research_notes": [
    "Tagesschau is retained as a public-facing editorial news brand rather than treating all ARD journalism as one source.",
    "ZDFheute is retained as the public-facing news brand for ZDF television news.",
    "phoenix remains its own source because it is a joint ARD/ZDF editorial product.",
    "WELT TV reuses canonical source key 'welt' because WELT documents an integrated Print/Digital/TV newsroom.",
    "Regional ARD information radios are candidates because they provide materially regional news agendas; they are not included merely to cover every state.",
